Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.85,0:01:33.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没跟你们说吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.05,0:01:37.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们战斗之后是一定会死的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.35,0:01:43.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千鹤 有时间的话 去趟铃森水族馆吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.75,0:01:46.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只是想跟我上床吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.75,0:01:49.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想要调查这个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.45,0:01:51.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,田中美纯 一等空尉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.55,0:01:52.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是令人不可思议的地方啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.75,0:01:55.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是什么力量在起作用呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.25,0:01:59.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.85,0:02:01.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.25,0:02:06.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.35,0:02:07.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.65,0:02:09.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.65,0:02:11.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是加古的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.65,0:02:15.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第 6 话 情欲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.35,0:02:25.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各位现在看到的图像
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.55,0:02:29.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这里广受好评的节目《南极之旅 360度》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.15,0:02:34.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据报告说 在那机器人的驾驶舱中能以这样的视野观察外界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.65,0:02:39.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然而 那里并不是像这样简单地把图像投影到墙上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.35,0:02:44.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,机器人与担任驾驶员的孩子们的意识直接相连
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.45,0:02:47.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,依照孩子们的想法 通过某种类似心灵感应的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.35,0:02:49.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,显示他们想看到的内容
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.65,0:02:55.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且 机器人是通过驾驶员的思想进行遥控的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.05,0:03:01.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这和我国的认知工程学研究有相通的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.45,0:03:06.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天认知工程学研究所的主任教授吉川小姐也来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.75,0:03:10.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉川小姐 您对刚才的话有何见解
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.85,0:03:15.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 实在是非常有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.05,0:03:20.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要说的不代表认知工程学研究所的观点 请多包涵
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.45,0:03:24.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,显然那机器人利用的视觉装置驱动原理
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.95,0:03:28.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经超越了现阶段国内的科技水平
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.15,0:03:32.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕也同样超越了整个世界的技术能力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.55,0:03:37.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是 可以说那个机器人来自地外?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.25,0:03:40.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们求助其他国家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.15,0:03:43.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,立即建立跨国调查体系
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.85,0:03:44.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请稍等
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.45,0:03:47.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在下结论还太早
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.45,0:03:52.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与中国签订了那个条约使我国的影响力相对缩小
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.15,0:03:56.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我国的技术仍然是全世界最先进的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.35,0:04:00.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果各位能放心 请交给我们进行调查
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.05,0:04:05.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首相 这件事国防军也不能撒手不管
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.65,0:04:10.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果出现了新的怪兽 我们肯定会彻底消灭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.05,0:04:13.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的意思我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.55,0:04:18.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽管我对你们很放心 但这样对邻国无法交待
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.45,0:04:22.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定下次怪兽就会出现在邻国
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.85,0:04:26.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保持警戒状态 继续调查
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.35,0:04:27.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,期待你们的成果
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.95,0:04:28.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.65,0:04:43.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这片子里没有企鹅么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.55,0:04:56.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行了么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.45,0:05:03.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 等多长时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.95,0:05:06.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没多久 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.65,0:05:07.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道路?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.05,0:05:08.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概是这边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.65,0:05:15.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道加古怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.75,0:05:18.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给他家打电话了 但是都不接
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.25,0:05:20.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会不在家
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.85,0:05:21.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那会在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.85,0:05:25.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到他之后怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.35,0:05:28.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经轮到他了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.55,0:05:30.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.45,0:05:33.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们找到他又能怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.85,0:05:36.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算不知道 我也不想放着他不管
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.35,0:06:12.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肥虫
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.55,0:06:13.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.05,0:06:19.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你啊 什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.85,0:06:22.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本大爷可是很忙的 有话快说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.15,0:06:26.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该知道加古在哪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.25,0:06:29.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来想说这个 终于喜欢上他了?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.25,0:06:31.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才没喜欢他
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.85,0:06:37.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你早晚会知道的 敌人出现在哪他就在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.65,0:06:39.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能告诉我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.85,0:06:42.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你当我是谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.65,0:06:45.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人家总有想独处的时候吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.65,0:06:49.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过敌人出来的话就算强拽也要把他弄过来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.25,0:06:53.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为下一个驾驶员就是他
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.05,0:07:01.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.35,0:07:06.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是加古在自然学校的同学
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.25,0:07:09.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想见一下加古 他在么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.45,0:07:12.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不在
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.15,0:07:14.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.05,0:07:17.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么要告诉你们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.15,0:07:20.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请不要再找他了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.25,0:07:29.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,田中姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.45,0:07:35.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 孩子们突然打扰您
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.85,0:07:41.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近加古稍微有点怪 他们挺担心的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.95,0:07:44.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且也联系不上他
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.05,0:07:47.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能告诉我们他在哪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.55,0:07:49.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不…不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.75,0:07:52.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您不知道自己的孩子在哪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.75,0:07:55.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 请别多管闲事了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.05,0:08:02.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.95,0:08:08.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是在找功吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.55,0:08:09.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.95,0:08:11.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是功的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.15,0:08:13.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.55,0:08:17.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到他有那么多朋友…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.35,0:08:22.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还真是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.75,0:08:25.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会在学校
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.45,0:08:27.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可不像去学校的人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.35,0:08:30.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有上补习班之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.35,0:08:32.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也没听他说过
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.25,0:08:36.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 千鹤 切江也来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.35,0:08:38.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加古在么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.85,0:08:39.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.25,0:08:43.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们跟他是一个学校吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.15,0:08:45.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有什么线索
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.45,0:08:49.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如他经常去的地方之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.55,0:08:52.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是游戏厅
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.85,0:08:56.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去找找看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.25,0:08:56.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.05,0:08:59.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先找地方把车停好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.05,0:09:02.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…我…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.15,0:09:05.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不愿意就算了 不用勉强自己一起来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.35,0:09:08.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.65,0:09:41.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然在这
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.85,0:09:47.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.05,0:09:51.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诸位日本国民 现在发表政府紧急通知
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.15,0:09:58.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,品川区上空发现新的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.95,0:10:01.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,政府现在宣布进入紧急状态
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.75,0:10:05.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请东京都 千叶县 神奈川县全境居民进行避难
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.95,0:10:14.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由于进入紧急状态 本次列车将在下一站停止运行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.95,0:10:15.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.05,0:10:52.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确认目标
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.45,0:10:57.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目标过大 雷达图像不确切
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.45,0:11:00.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,观测机 能否捕捉对象
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.85,0:11:06.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雷达红外图像不确切 可以通过目视确认
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.55,0:11:09.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 数据过来后瞄准
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.15,0:11:11.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部导弹开始装填
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.15,0:11:15.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 关闭全部导弹的雷达制导
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.05,0:11:17.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,使用激光制导
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.45,0:11:36.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.95,0:12:13.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于还是出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.15,0:12:26.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加古
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.95,0:12:29.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加古?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.55,0:12:42.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们…逃不掉…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.65,0:12:44.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我一样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.35,0:12:54.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一个真的就是我…吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.25,0:12:58.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.15,0:13:01.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么是我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.15,0:13:04.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是在做梦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.55,0:13:06.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大机器人? 全是胡扯的…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.95,0:13:08.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会有那种东西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.45,0:13:13.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去战斗? 就凭我? 驾驶Zearth?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.85,0:13:40.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋 我没叫你! 我叫你别过来!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.35,0:13:45.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不去 我不想去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.35,0:13:51.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加古…这是不是我们能左右的…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.35,0:13:53.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.55,0:13:56.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上去就会死的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.95,0:13:59.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要死了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.75,0:14:01.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真要死了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.95,0:14:05.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不只是你一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.45,0:14:07.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不也一样么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.15,0:14:13.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还在后面吧 我可是马上就要死了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.25,0:14:19.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 为什么 开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.65,0:14:22.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地球什么的关我屁事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.05,0:14:24.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地球上这帮人算什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.15,0:14:26.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都给我去死才好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.85,0:14:27.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.05,0:14:33.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我招谁惹谁了 全都冲我来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.45,0:14:38.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁也不拿我当回事 老爹根本不着家
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.45,0:14:40.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐也讨厌我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.85,0:14:42.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连老妈都…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.15,0:14:47.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我死了 谁都不会悲伤吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.75,0:14:50.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.75,0:14:54.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到底是为什么而出生的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.65,0:14:56.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.05,0:15:03.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能就这么死了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.65,0:15:06.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加古?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.25,0:15:11.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.85,0:15:14.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢你很久了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.45,0:15:19.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你又可爱 又那么聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.95,0:15:22.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.05,0:15:31.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千鹤
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.05,0:15:42.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,71式喷进弹命中
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.65,0:15:43.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,4号 8号准备完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.95,0:15:45.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,观测机的数据过来没有
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.05,0:15:46.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.25,0:15:48.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目标位置录入完成
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.85,0:15:50.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始发射
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.05,0:15:51.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发射
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.75,0:16:12.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好 没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.75,0:16:14.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敌人很大
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.05,0:16:32.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敌人在城市中央 一定要全部命中目标
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.45,0:16:35.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么大的靶子 肯定能命中
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.25,0:16:59.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加古 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.15,0:17:01.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要 别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.15,0:17:04.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么不可以的 你又吃不了什么亏
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.45,0:17:06.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.35,0:17:14.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.25,0:17:23.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加古
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.15,0:17:40.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加古?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.75,0:18:10.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与观测机的通信中断了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.95,0:18:12.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,切换至雷达瞄准
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.75,0:18:14.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一发 装填完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.45,0:18:15.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,6号 发射
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.65,0:19:12.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎命中了一般建筑
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.85,0:19:14.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快报告情况
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.15,0:19:14.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.35,0:19:45.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一下就被击沉了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.55,0:19:47.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞行部队也全军覆没
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.75,0:19:49.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有胜算吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.25,0:19:52.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停止攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.15,0:19:55.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,优先帮助居民避难及救援
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.45,0:19:55.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.35,0:19:58.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让横田基地派新的观测机
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.15,0:20:00.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就收集情报
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.35,0:20:06.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,表面在闪闪发光
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.85,0:20:25.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开胃菜结束了 接下来才是真格的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.85,0:20:38.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么还没开场就翘了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.95,0:20:42.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正怎么都要死 不如打了之后再死
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.75,0:20:47.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.85,0:20:54.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千鹤你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.45,0:21:03.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和加古干什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.65,0:21:08.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是这可麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.75,0:21:12.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样一来驾驶员不就少了一个了么
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.15,0:23:07.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,认真听我说话的老师
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.95,0:23:09.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不只是身体
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.85,0:23:13.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老师能满足我的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.75,0:23:17.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下回 伤

